{"name":"The Mirror Glass","slug":"glyph-mirror-glass","blurb":"On the palindrome street, Nova carries the glass toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Mirror. Click the glass and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Mirror Glass.","seal":"0732b70d553cc500232ba7bdaf6194850f98b65359d3b75eeae160ed0208bf05"}
